<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to E-commers-Crm</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f3f4f6;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 40px;">
        <!-- Header -->
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
              <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #111827; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600;">E-commers-Crm</h1>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <!-- Content -->
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="padding-top: 32px;">
          <tr>
            <td style="color: #374151; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Hi {{name}},</p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Welcome to E-commers-Crm! Your account has been created successfully.</p>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">You can now log in and start managing your real estate leads, properties, and deals.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center; padding: 16px 0;">
              <a href="{{loginUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #0ea5e9; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;">Log In to Your Account</a>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; padding-top: 24px;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Here are a few things you can do with E-commers-Crm:</p>
              <ul style="margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Manage leads through customizable Kanban boards</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Track properties, deals, and client relationships</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Automate tasks and follow-ups with AI insights</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Generate daily briefings and analytics reports</li>
              </ul>
              <p style="margin: 0;">Need help? Contact <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #0ea5e9;">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px;">
              <p style="margin: 0;">© {{year}} E-commers-Crm. All rights reserved.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
